---
import { Font } from "astro:assets";

import Image from "astro/components/Image.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
import Navbar from "../../components/nav/Navbar.astro";
import Layout from "../../layout/Layout.astro";

import JotLogo from "../../assets/logos/jot.svg";
import GPlayBadge from "../../assets/badges/gplay.svg";
---

<Font cssVariable="--font-roboto" preload />

<style>
  body {
    background-color: white;
    color: black;
  }

  main {
    font-family: var(--font-roboto);
  }

  *::selection {
    background-color: oklch(95.1% 0.026 236.824);
  }
</style>

<Layout
  title="Jot · biitle.nl"
  metaTitle="Jot"
  description="Distraction-free writing"
  url="https://biitle.nl/apps/jot"
>
  <Navbar />
  <main class="2xl:w-5xl gap-4 flex flex-col items-center">
    <p class="text-left text-5xl flex flex-col leading-normal">
      <Image
        src={JotLogo}
        alt="Jot Logo"
        class="w-24"
        width="96"
        height="96"
        loading="eager"
      />
      Imagine an app where you all you can do is write. You're fully focused on writing.

      <span class="mb-8">

      <div
        class="bg-[#faf8ff] text-[#1a1b20] w-4/5 aspect-[2 / 4] h-136 px-20 py-24 text-2xl rounded-sm select-none drop-shadow-xl"
      >
        <span class="text-neutral-400">
          The right app, font or certain tool doesn't matter. What's important to
          writing well is focus and all of your attention. If you want to write
          well, or do anything well, you need to focus.
        </span>
        <br><br>
        There are many ways to succeed at writing, but there are many more ways to
        fail. Successful writing is not luck. It's a matter of concentration, seriousness, and enjoyment.
      </div>

      <span class="h-12" />

      <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=nl.biitle.jot">
        <Image src={GPlayBadge} alt="Get it on Google Play" width=300 height=89 class="h-16" loading="eager" />
      </a>
    </p>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
